Hi Alex,

Three changes from today's executive committee:

1. Pet insurance: we launch pet insurance in April 2027 (about 25,000 policies in year
   one). Pet claims must be in the new platform from launch, including vet invoice upload
   and direct payment to the vet.

2. Instant payments: agreed with the bank. Claims under EUR 1,000 are paid by SEPA
   instant credit transfer, everything else stays in the daily file.

3. Go-live: the committee accepts a phased go-live after all. Motor and travel by
   1 September 2027, home and pet by March 2028. Please plan on that, not on 1 July.

Automatic settlement: compliance has agreed that motor glass claims under EUR 500 can be
paid without handler approval, with a weekly sample review. Everything else still needs a
handler.

Aoife Brennan
Chief Operating Officer
